  - m_Id: 357436139864428544
    m_Localized: This editor lets you create and adjust large intestine models with
      flexible tools. Control nodes allow smooth changes in shape, while presets
      speed up exploration of different forms. Each section can be refined for anatomical
      accuracy, and diseases can be placed to represent clinical cases.
